<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OTOMATISASI MEDIA AJAR AX-2026</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #05050a;
            --neon-cyan: #00f0ff;
            --neon-magenta: #ff0055;
            --neon-yellow: #ffee00;
            --text-color: #e0e0ed;
            --card-bg: #0d0e15;
            --border-glow: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.06), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.02), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.06));
            background-size: 100% 4px, 6px 100%;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* HEADER CYBERPUNK */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--neon-magenta);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .glitch-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan), 0 0 20px var(--neon-cyan);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--neon-yellow);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* SYSTEM STATUS / MAP SECTION */
        .system-status {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: var(--border-glow);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .system-status::before {
            content: "[ SYSTEM OVERVIEW ]";
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            left: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            padding: 0 10px;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        /* TIMELINE METODE */
        .grid-flow {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .step-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-cyan);
            padding: 15px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .step-card:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
            box-shadow: -5px 0 10px var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        .step-num {
            color: var(--neon-magenta);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* MATERI UTAMA */
        .materi-section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: var(--neon-magenta);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--neon-magenta);
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--neon-magenta);
        }

        .detail-box {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: var(--border-glow);
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .detail-box h3 {
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .detail-box ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .detail-box li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-left: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .detail-box li::before {
            content: ">";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--neon-yellow);
        }

        /* FOOTER BRANDING */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .btn-cyber {
            display: inline-block;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--neon-yellow);
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-yellow);
            padding: 12px 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 238, 0, 0.2);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-cyber:hover {
            background: var(--neon-yellow);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-yellow);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="glitch-title">MEDIA CORE AX-2026</div>
            <div class="subtitle">Otomatisasi Media Ajar 20 Menit Pasca-Tradisional</div>
        </header>

        <!-- ALUR KERJA CEPAT -->
        <section class="system-status">
            <div class="grid-flow">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num">01 // SCAN</div>
                    <strong>Google Scholar / Rumah Belajar</strong><br>Ekstraksi basis data & materi valid tanpa hoax.
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num">02 // PROCESS</div>
                    <strong>NotebookLM</strong><br>Sintesis AI untuk modul, bank soal, dan modul audio otomatis.
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num">03 // DESIGN</div>
                    <strong>Playground AI & Canva</strong><br>Otomatisasi aset visual massal dengan fitur Bulk Create.
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num">04 // INJECT</div>
                    <strong>Google Classroom</strong><br>Terminal akhir untuk otomatisasi rilis jadwal materi 1 bulan.
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- OPERASIONAL TEKNIS -->
        <section class="materi-section">
            <div class="section-title">[ PROTOKOL EKSEKUSI MATERI ]</div>
            
            <div class="detail-box">
                <h3>// NOTEBOOKLM: OTOT INTELIJEN</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Akurasi Mutlak:</strong> AI hanya membaca dokumen input (PDF/Link) untuk menghindari disinformasi.</li>
                    <li><strong>Ekstraksi Kilat:</strong> Cukup satu klik untuk menyusun soal evaluasi berbasis dokumen.</li>
                    <li><strong>Audio Overview:</strong> Mengubah teks pasif menjadi format obrolan audio (Podcast) edukasi yang adaptif untuk siswa.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-box">
                <h3>// MASS PRODUCTION: CANVA BULK CREATE</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Aset Unik:</strong> Sintesis gambar/ilustrasi menggunakan Playground AI atau Wayground.</li>
                    <li><strong>Otomatisasi Desain:</strong> Integrasi file CSV data soal langsung ke dalam layout template.</li>
                    <li><strong>Anti Copy-Paste:</strong> Menghasilkan puluhan media visual atau kartu soal dalam hitungan detik.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-box">
                <h3>// TERMINAL AKHIR: GOOGLE CLASSROOM</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Sinkronisasi Aset:</strong> Tempat muara penggabungan dokumen visual Canva dan audio NotebookLM.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sistem Penjadwalan:</strong> Mengaktifkan fitur "Schedule" untuk mendistribusikan materi berkala.</li>
                    <li><strong>Efisiensi Waktu:</strong> Mengelola siklus pembelajaran satu bulan hanya dalam 10 menit persiapan.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #888;">GURU KKA INFORMATIKA & PKWU // ALL SYSTEMS OPERATIONAL</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn-cyber">DOWNLOAD CHEAT SHEET PROMPT</a>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
